"Sort result by specify field. One of \"actual\", \"logical\", \"exclusive\", "
"\"shared\" or \"id\""
msgstr ""
"按指定字段对结果排序。可选字段：\"实际大小\"、\"逻辑大小\"、\"独占大小\"、\"共享大小\" 或 \"应用ID\""

#: ../apps/ll-cli/src/main.cpp:461
